hadiths[44]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1764","Malik related to me from a reliable source of his from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Basr ibn Said from Abu Said al-Khudri that Abu Musa al-Ashari said"
"1765","Malik related to me from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from another of the ulama of that time that Abu Musa al-Ashari came and asked permission from Umar ibn al-Khattab to enter. He asked permission three times"
"1766","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1767","Malik related to me from Nafi that when Abdullah ibn Umar sneezed and someone said to him"
"1768","Malik related to me from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Rafi ibn Ishaq"
"1769","Malik related to me from Abu'n-Nasr that Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud went to visit Abu Talha al-Ansari when he was ill. He said"
"1770","Malik related to me from Nafi from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad from A'isha"
"1771","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abdullah ibn Abd ar- Rahman ibn Abi Sasaca that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1772","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Abu Umama ibn Sahl ibn Hunayf from Abdullah ibn Abbas that Khalid ibn al-Walid ibn al-Mughira entered the house of Maimuna"
"1773","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that a man called the Messenger of Allah and said"
"1774","Malik related to me from Yazid ibn Khusayfa that as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid informed him that he heard Sufyan ibn Abi Zuhayr who was from the Azd Shanua tribe and among the companions of the Messenger of Allah"
"1775","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1776","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1777","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1778","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Sasaca from his father that Abu Said al-Khudri said that the Messenger of Allah"
"1779","Malik related to me from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1780","Malik related to me that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1781","Malik related to me from Nafi that one time as Ibn Umar was served his evening meal"
"1782","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud from Abdullah ibn Abbas from Maimuna"
"1783","Malik related to me from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar from Sahl ibn Sad as-Saidi that the Messenger of Allah"
"1784","Malik related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Hamza and Salim the sons of Abdullah ibn Umar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1785","Malik related to me that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1786","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that the Messenger of Allah"
"1787","Yahya related to me from Yahya ibn Said that Umar ibn al-Khattab asked a man what his name was. He said"
"1788","Malik related to me from Humayd at-Tawil that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1789","Malik related to me that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1790","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Ibn Muhayyisa al-Ansari"
"1791","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1792","Malik related to me that he heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab wanted to go to Iraq"
"1793","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abu Lubaba that the Messenger of Allah"
"1794","Malik related to me from Nafi from Sa'iba"
"1795","Malik related to me from Safiyy"
"1796","Malik related to me that he heard that when the Messenger of Allah"
"1797","Malik related to me from a reliable source of his from Yaqub ibn Abdullah al-Ashajj from Bushr ibn Said from Sad ibn Abi Waqqas from Khawla bint Hakim that the Messenger of Allah"
"1798","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Harmala from Amr ibn Shuayb from his father from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1799","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Harmala that Said ibn al-Musayyab heard the Messenger of Allah"
"1800","Malik related to me from Said ibn Abi Said al-Maqburi from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1801","Malik related to me from Abu Ubayd"
"1802","Malik related to me from Sumayy"
"1803","Malik related to me that he heard that Abu Hurayra said that the Messenger of Allah"
"1804","Malik related to me that he heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab went to the villages every Saturday. If he found a slave doing work which he was not capable of doing"
"1805","Malik related to me from his paternal uncle"
"1806","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1807","Malik related to me that he heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab saw a female slave belonging to Abdullah ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab. She was dressed like free (non-slave) women. He went to his daughter Hafsa and said"